,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723456071,"data":"=== CONFIGURED DECISION RULES (chosen, not discovered) ===\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723460241,"data":"  PSI bands            stable \u003c 0.1, moderate \u003c= 0.25, severe above\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723465082,"data":"  KS multiplicity      Benjamini-Hochberg at alpha = 0.05\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723469305,"data":"  Temporal association Spearman, flag at |rho| \u003e= 0.3 (Section 10 shows the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723473728,"data":"                       empirical distribution this cut-off sits in)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.7234783,"data":"  Lift stability       1 - coefficient of variation, \"stable\" at \u003e= 0.75, and only\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723483058,"data":"                       estimated with \u003e= 3 blocks and \u003e= 30 positives\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723487741,"data":"  Cluster redundancy   distance 1 - |Spearman| \u003c= 0.1, co-membership \u003e= 0.75\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.7234953,"data":"                       across development blocks\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723499649,"data":"  Entity cold start    moderate at \u003e= 5%, high at \u003e= 20% of OOT rows with a value\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723504251,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723508231,"data":"=== METHODOLOGICAL INTERPRETATION ===\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723512305,"data":"  * Every fitted object above - bin edges, decile cut points, cluster maps,\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723541007,"data":"    mutual-information scores, the correlation threshold, the seen-value sets -\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723552082,"data":"    is registered in the leakage auditor with the blocks it was fitted on. The\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723556618,"data":"    registry, printed in the run manifest, is the auditable form of the claim\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723560894,"data":"    that OOT was quarantined.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723564969,"data":"  * OOT appears as an evaluation-only comparison sample and as the population\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723568968,"data":"    whose cold-start exposure is measured. Development feature verdicts do not\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723573012,"data":"    read OOT statistics. Entity cold-start classifications are explicitly marked\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723577211,"data":"    decision_scope=oot_evaluation_only and must not be represented as development-only.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723587614,"data":"  * Association is not causation, and predictive lift is not an effect. A\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723591889,"data":"    missingness indicator that separates fraud may be recording a failed join\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723596055,"data":"    rather than customer behaviour; the ProductCD stratification in Section 6\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723600313,"data":"    is what distinguishes the two, not the aggregate contrast.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.72360438,"data":"  * Shared card, address, email-domain or device values are shared ATTRIBUTES.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723608487,"data":"    They do not establish that two transactions belong to one person, and no\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723612457,"data":"    composite identity is built here.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723616449,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723628722,"data":"=== RECOMMENDATIONS FOR LATER MODELLING (not results) ===\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723633114,"data":"  1. Forward-chaining folds with an embargo; random cross-validation must never\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723637648,"data":"     be the primary estimate.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723641478,"data":"  2. Fit every encoder, scaler, imputer and reducer inside the training fold.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723645616,"data":"     The redundancy groups above say what COULD be reduced, not a fitted reducer.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723649734,"data":"  3. Report PR-AUC and recall at a fixed FPR per block, and separately for\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723653929,"data":"     warm-start and cold-start entities; ROC-AUC alone is inadequate at ~3.5%\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723657957,"data":"     prevalence.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723661996,"data":"  4. Treat 'tag_not_drop' features as carried-with-a-tag, and test their removal\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1466.723666182,"data":"     as an ablation rather than assuming it.\n"}
